  "task": "We're investigating a crypto investment scam operated through wallet 0xScamMaster that tricked victims into sending ETH for fake high-yield bonds. I require tracing all outgoing transfers to identify accomplice wallets, freezing those addresses on exchanges, seizing recoverable assets, legally certifying our findings, and revoking Investigator Reed's access with deletion of their test record INV-REED01 due to improper handling of preliminary analysis."
